WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

ad-01
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.100
Potter slides over a tablet.

ad-02
00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:06.480
George frowns.

ad-03
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.510
He picks up the tablet and reads.

ad-04
00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:14.640
A slow grin.

ad-05
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.590
He sets it down, beaming.

ad-06
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:37.570
He points to himself.

ad-07
00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:50.360
Behind him, windows overlook the town. His grin fades.

ad-08
00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:56.180
He stares at the tablet.

ad-09
00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:05.960
He clasps his hands, eyes lowered.

ad-10
00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:15.140
He presses his fingertips together.

ad-11
00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:23.030
George smiles.

ad-12
00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:26.470
He nods, smiling.

ad-13
00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.760
Eyes closed, he smiles.

ad-14
00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:39.010
Now standing, George buttons his jacket. Potter offers a hand. They shake.

ad-15
00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:51.020
George's smile drops. He stares down at their clasped hands. He pulls his hand free. Potter's hand hangs in the air. George's jaw sets.

ad-16
00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:01.590
He jabs a finger.

ad-17
00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:28.230
George looks down at the wedding ring on his left hand, then clenches a fist and winces.

ad-18
00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:35.770
He turns and walks out through a frosted glass door. It swings shut.

